<section class="acdh-about" aria-labelledby="acdh-services-heading">
  <h2 id="acdh-services-heading">Vocabs services</h2>
  <p>Controlled vocabularies provide stable references for scholarly work and help projects make their data interoperable. ACDH provides services for the collaborative creation, maintenance and publication of vocabularies and taxonomies.</p>
  <p>This browse service is based on <a href="https://skosmos.org/">Skosmos</a> and uses <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/skos-reference/">SKOS</a> as its underlying data model.</p>
  <p>Vocabs supports ACDH projects, partners in the <a href="https://clariah.at/">CLARIAH-AT</a> consortium and the <a href="https://www.dariah.eu/">DARIAH-EU</a> community.</p>
</section>

